// Project.cdz — the agent-harness bootstrap reducers as a Cadenza project, so their behavioral @tests
// run on the seed compiler (`cdz test`) + are gated per-input by v-nix's testCadenzaProject derivation,
// INDEPENDENT of the kernel host adapter. `entry` = the primary reducer (B1); `tests` = all three
// reducer fixtures (each carries @test defs guarding its fold behavior).
def name = "reducer-cadenza"
def entry = "reducer_b1.cdz"
def tests = ["reducer_b1.cdz", "reducer_b2.cdz", "reducer_b3.cdz", "reducer_pure.cdz"]
